  "solution": "**Formula Used:**\n\n**1.** For x > 1\n\n If x+(1)/(x)=k, then x-(1)/(x)=sqrt{k²-4}\n\n**2.** If x+(1)/(x)=k, then x³+(1)/(x³)=k³-3k\n\n**3.** If x-(1)/(x)=k, then x³-(1)/(x³)=k³+3k\n\n**4.** a² - b² = (a + b) (a - b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx+(1)/(x)=5sqrt2\n\n⇒ x-(1)/(x) = sqrt{(5sqrt2)²-4} = sqrt{46} ----(1)\n\nx+(1)/(x)=5sqrt2\n\n⇒ x³+(1)/(x³) = (5sqrt2)³-3(5sqrt2)\n\n⇒ x³+(1)/(x³) = 250sqrt2-15sqrt2 = 235sqrt2 ----(2)\n\nx-(1)/(x) = sqrt{46}\n\n⇒ x³-(1)/(x³) = (sqrt{46})³+3sqrt{46}\n\n⇒ x³-(1)/(x³) = 46sqrt{46}+3sqrt{46} = 49sqrt{46} ----(3)\n\nNow,\n\nx⁶-(1)/(x⁶) = (x³+(1)/(x³)) (x³-(1)/(x³))\n\n⇒ x⁶-(1)/(x⁶) = 235sqrt2 × 49sqrt{46}\n\n⇒ x⁶-(1)/(x⁶) = 11515sqrt{92} = 11515sqrt{4×23}\n\n⇒ x⁶-(1)/(x⁶) = 11515×2sqrt{23} = 23030sqrt{23}",
